{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792467546108,"sessionID":"ses_ea89c2259ffeDxyx2cdgHZfkjg","part":{"partID":"prt_157642e7a001IFgs1txyxKoVGn","sessionID":"ses_ea89c2259ffeDxyx2cdgHZfkjg","messageID":"msg_1576421b5001Qsb74GY9lyH5zr","type":"tool","id":"call_00_i0aebwilmtdb3rvf1fqcm8kx","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-decisions_defaults/source/REVISION.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-decisions_defaults/source/REVISION.md, lines 1-2\n1: Apply only the exact authorized R6 source-reference and explanation revision; inherit all nine verified attempt-4\n2: program bytes, with no automatic business repair.","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-decisions_defaults/source/REVISION.md, lines 1-2\n1: Apply only the exact authorized R6 source-reference and explanation revision; inherit all nine verified attempt-4\n2: program bytes, with no automatic business repair."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-decisions_defaults/source/REVISION.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792467545722,"end":1792467546108}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792467546109,"sessionID":"ses_ea89c2259ffeDxyx2cdgHZfkjg","part":{"partID":"prt_157642f39001130qj53Q9ElVs8","sessionID":"ses_ea89c2259ffeDxyx2cdgHZfkjg","messageID":"msg_1576421b5001Qsb74GY9lyH5zr","type":"tool","id":"call_01_sbrg6w29vqxrzghwox78p2k6","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-decisions_defaults/source/RESEARCH.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-decisions_defaults/source/RESEARCH.md, lines 1-69\n1: {\n2:   \"gaps\": [\n3:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n4:     \"Behavior of Ripple TS reactivity primitives (track/effect/bindGroup/bindValue) at this pinned version was not\n5: validated.\",\n6:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n7:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence inf-no-tests: Depends on a quarantined, unlocated observation\",\n8:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n9:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence obs-no-test-files: observation cites an unknown source path: source/src\",\n10:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n11:     \"No automated tests exist in the manifest, so none of the described behaviors are test-confirmed.\",\n12:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n13:     \"Runtime behavior was not observed; all claims are static reading of source files.\",\n14:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n15:     \"The full commit tree was inferred from the supplied source_manifest and the on-disk source/ directory; files\n16: outside it were not inspected.\",\n17:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n18:     \"The paired Research Notes referenced by leaf.md were not supplied, so product-level evidence beyond the pinned\n19: repository is unavailable.\",\n20:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n21:     \"Whether Dexie/IndexedDB persistence behaves correctly in real browsers at this commit is unverified.\",\n22:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n23:     \"Whether the third-party metadata/favicon endpoints (api.microlink.io, images.weserv.nl, Google s2 favicons) are\n24: reachable, rate-limited, or CORS-permitted at runtime is unverified.\"\n25:   ],\n26:   \"summary\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858 [code_observation]: New records are built with id\n27: `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname from getHostname(url), and defaults visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false,\n28: isArchived=false, createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id, isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and\n29: visitedAt.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a [code_observation]: Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the\n30: item is not archived, and Edit loads the item's url/title/description/tags/favicon into the\n31: dialog.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5 [code_observation]: The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL\n32: matching /^https?:\\\\/\\\\/(?:[\\\\w-]+\\\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\\\/\\\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-\n33: empty description up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043 [inference]:\n34: The scenario's user-controlled 'category' (归类) is realized only as up to five free-text tags on each record; there are\n35: no creatable, renameable, or nestable collections, and no separate move operation beyond editing\n36: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb [code_observation]: saveBookmark sets the record in the in-memory map then\n37: awaits db.bookmarks.put(bm); deleteBookmark removes from the map then awaits\n38: db.bookmarks.delete(id).\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1 [code_observation]: A Delete action is rendered only for\n39: archived items; it calls deleteBookmark and shows an error-type toast with an Undo action that calls saveBookmark(item)\n40: to restore the record.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31 [inference]: The scenario step of letting unclassified links\n41: land in a default category is not supported, because the form schema rejects saves with zero\n42: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db [code_observation]: A Copy URL action writes item.url to the clipboard and\n43: shows a success toast.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759 [inference]: Metadata and favicon enrichment is best-effort\n44: and dependent on third-party HTTP services; failures degrade silently to console errors while the bookmark still saves\n45: with whatever fields the user entered or omitted defaults for.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8 [code_observation]:\n46: An effect on component creation calls db.bookmarks.toArray() and inserts each returned bookmark into an in-memory\n47: RippleMap keyed by bookmark id.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba [code_observation]: On submit, if no favicon exists\n48: and a hostname is derivable, the code fetches a Google s2 favicon proxied through images.weserv.nl inside a try/catch\n49: that only logs failure.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99 [inference]: Persistence is local to one browser\n50: profile/device via IndexedDB with no sync layer, so the scenario's cross-session growth holds only on the same browser,\n51: and the leaf's multi-device context is unmet.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab [inference]: Deletion is limited to\n52: archived records and recovery is only the transient Undo action on the toast; there is no trash view, and non-archived\n53: records cannot be deleted at all through the UI.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11 [code_observation]: The Visit\n54: action builds an updated bookmark with visitedAt=Date.now() and visitCount+1, calls saveBookmark(updated), then opens\n55: the URL with window.open(item.url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer').\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\n56: [code_observation]: The displayed list filters by isArchived matching the active tab, requires every selected tag to be\n57: present in bookmark.tags, matches search only against bookmark.title.toLowerCase(), and sorts pinned-first then by the\n58: chosen sort mode with createdAt descending as fallback.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998 [code_observation]: The\n59: Archive/Unarchive action toggles isArchived and, when archiving, forces isPinned=false before\n60: saving.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628 [code_observation]: Tag counts are derived by iterating all in-memory\n61: bookmarks and counting each tag occurrence, then sorted alphabetically for the\n62: sidebar.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1 [inference]: Retrieval by keyword covers only bookmark titles, not URLs,\n63: descriptions, or tag names, so the scenario's 'find by a remembered word' workflow is partially\n64: supported.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9 [inference]: The app supports the scenario's save-now/find-later loop: a\n65: deliberate add dialog writes a URL-anchored record into durable IndexedDB, and the record can later be browsed, tag-\n66: filtered, title-searched, and opened back to the live URL.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287 [code_observation]:\n67: fetchMeta calls https://api.microlink.io/?url=... and, on success with result.data, sets title/description and fetches\n68: the logo through https://images.weserv.nl/; errors are only console.error'd and the finally block resets loading.\"\n69: }","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-decisions_defaults/source/RESEARCH.md, lines 1-69\n1: {\n2:   \"gaps\": [\n3:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n4:     \"Behavior of Ripple TS reactivity primitives (track/effect/bindGroup/bindValue) at this pinned version was not\n5: validated.\",\n6:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n7:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence inf-no-tests: Depends on a quarantined, unlocated observation\",\n8:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n9:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence obs-no-test-files: observation cites an unknown source path: source/src\",\n10:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n11:     \"No automated tests exist in the manifest, so none of the described behaviors are test-confirmed.\",\n12:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n13:     \"Runtime behavior was not observed; all claims are static reading of source files.\",\n14:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n15:     \"The full commit tree was inferred from the supplied source_manifest and the on-disk source/ directory; files\n16: outside it were not inspected.\",\n17:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n18:     \"The paired Research Notes referenced by leaf.md were not supplied, so product-level evidence beyond the pinned\n19: repository is unavailable.\",\n20:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n21:     \"Whether Dexie/IndexedDB persistence behaves correctly in real browsers at this commit is unverified.\",\n22:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n23:     \"Whether the third-party metadata/favicon endpoints (api.microlink.io, images.weserv.nl, Google s2 favicons) are\n24: reachable, rate-limited, or CORS-permitted at runtime is unverified.\"\n25:   ],\n26:   \"summary\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858 [code_observation]: New records are built with id\n27: `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname from getHostname(url), and defaults visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false,\n28: isArchived=false, createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id, isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and\n29: visitedAt.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a [code_observation]: Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the\n30: item is not archived, and Edit loads the item's url/title/description/tags/favicon into the\n31: dialog.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5 [code_observation]: The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL\n32: matching /^https?:\\\\/\\\\/(?:[\\\\w-]+\\\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\\\/\\\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-\n33: empty description up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043 [inference]:\n34: The scenario's user-controlled 'category' (归类) is realized only as up to five free-text tags on each record; there are\n35: no creatable, renameable, or nestable collections, and no separate move operation beyond editing\n36: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb [code_observation]: saveBookmark sets the record in the in-memory map then\n37: awaits db.bookmarks.put(bm); deleteBookmark removes from the map then awaits\n38: db.bookmarks.delete(id).\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1 [code_observation]: A Delete action is rendered only for\n39: archived items; it calls deleteBookmark and shows an error-type toast with an Undo action that calls saveBookmark(item)\n40: to restore the record.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31 [inference]: The scenario step of letting unclassified links\n41: land in a default category is not supported, because the form schema rejects saves with zero\n42: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db [code_observation]: A Copy URL action writes item.url to the clipboard and\n43: shows a success toast.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759 [inference]: Metadata and favicon enrichment is best-effort\n44: and dependent on third-party HTTP services; failures degrade silently to console errors while the bookmark still saves\n45: with whatever fields the user entered or omitted defaults for.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8 [code_observation]:\n46: An effect on component creation calls db.bookmarks.toArray() and inserts each returned bookmark into an in-memory\n47: RippleMap keyed by bookmark id.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba [code_observation]: On submit, if no favicon exists\n48: and a hostname is derivable, the code fetches a Google s2 favicon proxied through images.weserv.nl inside a try/catch\n49: that only logs failure.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99 [inference]: Persistence is local to one browser\n50: profile/device via IndexedDB with no sync layer, so the scenario's cross-session growth holds only on the same browser,\n51: and the leaf's multi-device context is unmet.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab [inference]: Deletion is limited to\n52: archived records and recovery is only the transient Undo action on the toast; there is no trash view, and non-archived\n53: records cannot be deleted at all through the UI.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11 [code_observation]: The Visit\n54: action builds an updated bookmark with visitedAt=Date.now() and visitCount+1, calls saveBookmark(updated), then opens\n55: the URL with window.open(item.url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer').\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\n56: [code_observation]: The displayed list filters by isArchived matching the active tab, requires every selected tag to be\n57: present in bookmark.tags, matches search only against bookmark.title.toLowerCase(), and sorts pinned-first then by the\n58: chosen sort mode with createdAt descending as fallback.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998 [code_observation]: The\n59: Archive/Unarchive action toggles isArchived and, when archiving, forces isPinned=false before\n60: saving.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628 [code_observation]: Tag counts are derived by iterating all in-memory\n61: bookmarks and counting each tag occurrence, then sorted alphabetically for the\n62: sidebar.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1 [inference]: Retrieval by keyword covers only bookmark titles, not URLs,\n63: descriptions, or tag names, so the scenario's 'find by a remembered word' workflow is partially\n64: supported.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9 [inference]: The app supports the scenario's save-now/find-later loop: a\n65: deliberate add dialog writes a URL-anchored record into durable IndexedDB, and the record can later be browsed, tag-\n66: filtered, title-searched, and opened back to the live URL.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287 [code_observation]:\n67: fetchMeta calls https://api.microlink.io/?url=... and, on success with result.data, sets title/description and fetches\n68: the logo through https://images.weserv.nl/; errors are only console.error'd and the finally block resets loading.\"\n69: }"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-bbc43771a1bbbe99-decisions_defaults/source/RESEARCH.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792467545913,"end":1792467546109}}}}
